<command>
object_detector.execute(image='path/to/image.png', labels=['Doorway with red A color on the wall'])
</command>

Once the depth map of the doorway is obtained, the relative position can be confirmed by comparing it with the depth maps of the table and chair. If the doorway is closer to the camera position, the coordinate of the doorway would be higher in the depth map compared to the other two objects.
